|name = [[Giant frogs]]
|locations = [[Lumbridge Swamp]]
|combat = 13
|hitpoints = 23
|requirements = None
|recommendations = Bring your best armour ([[chainbody]] recommended) and weapons.
|advantages = * High HP (23), low defence, and they deal little damage.
*Always drops [[big bones]] which can be sold for guaranteed profit ({{Coins|{{GEP|Big bones}}}}) or used for [[Prayer]] experience while training.
